WEBVTT

00:21:29.163 --> 00:21:30.704
It never occurred to me.

00:21:30.704 --> 00:21:36.288
It absolutely never occurred to me that
it was possible to leave my state to

00:21:36.288 --> 00:21:37.954
go to college. Like to me,

00:21:37.954 --> 00:21:42.663
the furthest even going to college
seemed like going a very far.

00:21:42.704 --> 00:21:47.996
Our way and the reason I didn't know
to apply to more than one is

00:21:47.996 --> 00:21:54.829
because nobody told me. I wasn't folded
into anyone's arms when it came to like,

00:21:54.829 --> 00:21:58.496
well, let's talk about college,
let's talk about your options,

00:21:58.496 --> 00:21:59.746
let's talk about the process.